{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/7f0bbb170dec29e74ab866fa2c07b493.avif?t=1752975717\" alt=\"Horde Slayer, 4 player co-op\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horde Slayer\u00a0</strong>is an <i>online co-op or solo roguelite RPG</i> where you battle endless hordes of monsters across unsacred, cursed lands. Face the darkness alone, or join forces with up to three allies to purge evil together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/cfd0e0745d6db9faf97911d3f807027a.poster.avif?t=1752975717\" aria-label=\"Hero Classes\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/cfd0e0745d6db9faf97911d3f807027a.webm?t=1752975717\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/cfd0e0745d6db9faf97911d3f807027a.mp4?t=1752975717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wizard</strong> - Command the raw power of fire, frost, and arcane magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ranger</strong> - Strike from afar with your trusty bow and clever traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slayer</strong> - Cleave through foes with steel and brute strength, right in the heart of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/2559424924a0b93b3c18e2d0c68d28da.poster.avif?t=1752975717\" aria-label=\"Forge your own build\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/2559424924a0b93b3c18e2d0c68d28da.webm?t=1752975717\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/2559424924a0b93b3c18e2d0c68d28da.mp4?t=1752975717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect</strong> and <strong>equip</strong> a variety of powerful abilities to craft unique and devastating builds. Mix elements, master melee or ranged combat, and become the ultimate slayer of hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/34e0a91246e77bc1f6c8a3d0b9cc85cb.poster.avif?t=1752975717\" aria-label=\"Battle Across Dark Realms\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/34e0a91246e77bc1f6c8a3d0b9cc85cb.webm?t=1752975717\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/extras/34e0a91246e77bc1f6c8a3d0b9cc85cb.mp4?t=1752975717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse cursed cemeteries, forgotten ruins, and ancient ritual grounds as you push back the darkness. More deadly maps and sinister locations await in future updates!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778250?t=1752975717","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778250?t=1752975717","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/8fbd4aefef772b2044f179dc542e876422570897/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752975717","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778250/8fbd4aefef772b2044f179dc542e876422570897/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752975717","categories":[{"de